<title>JAPAN: JR East plans 229 bln yen 97/98 capital investment.</title>
<headline>JR East plans 229 bln yen 97/98 capital investment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Japan Railway Co said on Friday that it plans fresh capital investment of 229.3 billion yen in fiscal 1997/98.  </p>
<p>A company spokesman said the firm expects its capital outlay in 1996/97 business year to March 31 to total 290.1 billion yen.</p>
</text>
